<h2>Orders, Pricing, and Payment</h2>

<h3>Orders</h3>
<ul>
  <li>You order meals for specific days and time slots within the next <strong>7 days</strong></li>
  <li><strong>Each day's delivery is a separate item of your order</strong> and is treated individually for cancellation and refunds</li>
  <li>Orders are paid in full at checkout</li>
  <li>Orders are subject to acceptance, slot availability, and item availability; we may refuse or cancel orders for reasons including suspected fraud, pricing errors, or unavailability</li>
  <li>Ordering for a given day closes at that day's <strong>cutoff time</strong>, because ingredients are purchased against actual orders each morning</li>
</ul>

<h3>Pricing</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Prices are shown in the App and include applicable taxes (GST as per Indian law)</li>
  <li>We may run promotions, discounts, or coupons subject to the specific terms shown at the time of the offer</li>
