<h2>Cancellations &amp; Refunds</h2>
<p>Simple and honest — the same rules the App enforces:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Cancel a delivery day before its cutoff:</strong> the full amount for that day is credited to your Refresh wallet instantly. Wallet credits are <strong>usable on orders · not withdrawable</strong>, and apply automatically to your next order</li>
  <li><strong>After the cutoff:</strong> the kitchen has already started cooking for you, so that day cannot be cancelled or refunded</li>
  <li><strong>If we fail you</strong> (meal not delivered, quality issue, or kitchen emergency): the affected day is credited in full — and we make it right</li>
  <li><strong>Failed payments</strong> are auto-reconciled; a charge with no matching order is refunded to source</li>
</ul>

